+ * Is equivalent to: 
+ *      apply([p1, p2 ... pn], f1) || 
+ *      apply([p1, p2 ... pn], f2) || 
+ *      apply([p1, p2 ... pn], f3) ... apply(fn, [p1, p2 ... pn])  
